Paste this exact line into Render's "Start Command" field when creating the Web Service
(Render injects the $PORT environment variable itself — do not hardcode a port number):

gunicorn -w 4 -b 0.0.0.0:$PORT app:superkart_api

Build Command:
pip install -r requirements.txt

Root Directory (if backend/ and frontend/ live in the same repo):
backend
